<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		23/15 D	June	    25/15 D</p>
<p> July		18/15 D	July	    20/15 D</p>
<p> August	    10/30 P	August	  20/30 P</p>
<p> Sept	     90/120 P	Sept	   95/120 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		30/29 D	June	    30/29 D</p>
<p> July		31/29 D	July	    31/29 D</p>
<p> August	    11/10 D	August	  11/10 D</p>
<p> Sept		  5/7 P	Sept		9/7 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		30/60 P	 June	   30/60 P</p>
<p> July		40/50 P	 July	   40/50 P</p>
<p> August	  even/40 P	 August     even/40 P</p>
<p> Sept	    even/30 P	 Sept	 even/30 P</p>
